	(descr "Three PCB-only plated battery-wire solder pads; pads 1 and 2 keep the exact positions of the 2-pad variant, pad 3 is added 2.54 mm beyond pad 2; 2.54 mm centre pitch, 1.0 mm drill, 2.0 mm copper; pad 1 = BAT+, pad 2 = BAT- (pack negative / board GND), pad 3 = NTC (cell-bonded 10k thermistor sense, wired to the pack negative); no fitted connector; external strain relief required")
